<!-- Google Play Games Services IDs (ACHIEVEMENTS.md §2, Play Games backend).

     game_services_project_id: replace the placeholder with the numeric
     project ID the Play Console assigns when Play Games Services is
     configured for the app (referenced from AndroidManifest.xml as the
     com.google.android.gms.games.APP_ID meta-data). With the placeholder in
     place the SDK initialises but sign-in fails, so achievements are
     silently off — the game is unaffected.

     Achievements: uncomment each entry and paste the ID the Play Console
     generates for it. The resource NAMES are fixed by the mapping table in
     play_games_achievements.cpp (authoritative) — keep them exactly as
     written here even though the console's own "Get resources" export
     derives different names from the display names. An entry left missing
     just drops that achievement's earns with a logcat warning. coop_clear
     is deliberately absent until netplay (ACHIEVEMENTS.md §5). -->
